OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a chilly start, most
OL,6,Fareas will have a dry day on Saturday
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells. However, a north to
OL,8,Fnortheasterly breeze will feed some
OL,9,Fshowers into the east and southeast of
OL,10,FEngland, with a few also affecting
OL,11,FNorthern Scotland.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBreezy and showery conditions
OL,14,Fwill continue to affect the east and
OL,15,Fsoutheast of England overnight.
OL,16,FLargely dry elsewhere with clear
OL,17,Fperiods and lighter winds. Patches of
OL,18,Ffog and frost forming.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
