OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FThe east, and more especially
OL,6,Fsoutheast of England will remain
OL,7,Fbreezy with showers, some heavy.
OL,8,FShowers may extend westwards into
OL,9,Fcentral and southern England later.
OL,10,FFine elsewhere with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
